<title>MALAYSIA: Tractors Malaysia year net up 69 pct.</title>
<headline>Tractors Malaysia year net up 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  91.0     vs	53.9</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 28.1     vs	16.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,547.6    vs    1,239.2</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   150.4    vs	 85.9</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  9.9    vs  less  4.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	   -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	16.0    vs	  14.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Tractors Malaysia Holdings Bhd sells industrial, commercial and passenger vehicles, and agricultural and industrial machines.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
